# CVEs the trivy scan of the CI ignores, shared by every image it scans
# (docker-publish.yml). Add an entry only for a vulnerability without a fix
# that the image cannot avoid, with a comment naming the package and the image,
# and remove it as soon as the scan passes without it.
# openssl (libssl3t64, yhub image, distroless nodejs22-debian13): QUIC denial
# of service, no fix in trivy yet. Node bundles its own OpenSSL, nothing in the
# image loads the system libssl, and yhub does not use QUIC.
CVE-2026-107494
CVE-2026-124709
